#AGE CALCULATOR
A beginner Python project that determines the user's age with the data input by the user in years,months and days.

## Features
-calculates age in years , months and days.
-determines whether the user is an (18+) adult or minor.

##Skills used 
- input and output 
- variable
- integer converison using str
- use of if/else
- basic data calculations

